    760  f0b7							; --- Cave TIA restores inside the VBL window (moved 2026-10-06) ---
    761  f0b7							; Was inline between VBL-tail and .Row: making it a jsr'd KernelInit
    762  f0b7							; added ~19c + an entry WSYNC to the cycle-precise VBL-tail→.Row span
    763  f0b7							; → wall 263→264 every frame. Inits live HERE (window headroom
    764  f0b7							; 1472-1076 ≈ 396c, cost ~25c) so the entry span SHRINKS vs inline.
    765  f0b7							; HUD cannot clobber these: HUD runs AFTER the kernel each frame.
    766  f0b7		       a9 30		      lda	#$30	; NUSIZ0 = single copy P0 + M0 width 8
    767  f0b9		       85 04		      sta	NUSIZ0
    768  f0bb							; NUSIZ1 + CTRLPF restores DELETED (P2b): bank2 StageBandTab owns both
    769  f0bb							; every VBL (door drives M1 4clk / ball 4clk). TitleKernel re-establishes
