    826  f0d4							; Structure:
    827  f0d4							;   .Row (×3): set PF registers once per color band, init scanline counter
    828  f0d4							;   .Line (×48): render one scanline — sprite check + loop control
    829  f0d4							;
    830  f0d4							; PF registers persist in TIA, so writing once per tile row is sufficient.
    831  f0d4							; The inner .Line loop has NO PF writes — only sprite rendering.
    832  f0d4							; ==============================================================================
