    890  f0ef							; --- Per-band ball gate (Phase 3): BandTab[row] $ff/$00 → ENABL ---
    891  f0ef							; Takes the slot of the per-band `lda Temp / sta COLUBK` (VBL writes
    892  f0ef							; COLUBK once now) — same position, +1c (7c gate vs 6c pair), PF2 shifts
    893  f0ef							; c61→c62 (later = right half keeps OLD band even longer, thin-yellow fix
    894  f0ef							; intact). TIA latches ENABL per line: set on this setup line → ball on
    895  f0ef							; from the band's first body line; water + HUD inherit row2's value
