   1021  f11f							;   -> after iny Y<=11: always fetchable, so
   1022  f11f							;   the old `cpy #PLAYER_SPRITE_H / bcs
   1023  f11f							;   .GrpZero` here was DEAD 4c on the worst
   1024  f11f							;   path (2+2, never taken — A0=11+ never
   1025  f11f							;   reaches it, it goes to bcs .GrpSkip).
