   1566  f36c							; StepDown: try one pixel of downward movement (called per pixel of vy).
   1567  f36c							; A pixel is rejected when the footprint enters a solid tile (player lands
   1568  f36c							; and vy is zeroed). At PLAYER_MAX_Y the room's down connection is followed.
