   3856  fca5							; depth the 12-row sprite had at 125).
   3857  fca5							; Same path as hot/enemy: lose life, then respawn 12 scanlines up (min 0).
   3858  fca5							; Band color = VBLANK-staged RoomBandColor ($D2, PF1Buf[3] dead-row alias;
   3859  fca5							; staged by the VBLANK fold from LevelEnemy+RoomNo*4+3 — a kernel-time fold
   3860  fca5							; overruns the .WaterRow line). Read inlined here and in .WaterRow (0 = off).
