   3875  fcb3							; which freezes RoomY as the drop destiny. Shifting after the call was dead
   3876  fcb3							; code — a water death respawned at the death Y (inside the strip, >= 125) and
   3877  fcb3							; the player died again on landing, unable to fly out (user report 2026-10-21).
   3878  fcb3							; The shift is one tile (spec: -= 12, not the whole band): the band check
   3879  fcb3							; tests the sprite ORIGIN (RoomY >= 115), so 115 -> 103 clears the strip.
