   4004  fd36							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4005  fd36							; TitleWork — merged title/level-select screen (DropTarget = $FD sentinel,
   4006  fd36							; dispatched from DropStep every frame). The TitleKernel shows the logo, the
   4007  fd36							; selected level number (digits band) and the credits; the theme plays here.
   4008  fd36							; No gravity/enemies/sound beyond the music (frame is title-owned; timer
   4009  fd36							; frozen). SELECT cycles Level, RESET starts the game at the selected level.
   4010  fd36							;   SELECT (SWCHB b1, active-low EDGE) → jsr TitleSelect (fill): level+1,
   4011  fd36							;	    wrap → 000001, reload room 0 (swallow removed 2026-10-07, 8b —
   4012  fd36							;	    the intro exit ate the first press and made #2 read as dead)
   4013  fd36							;   RESET  (SWCHB b0, active-low EDGE) → score 000000, LoadLevel tail arms
   4014  fd36							;	    the real drop-in → gameplay starts
   4015  fd36							; ($FD reaches here directly — merged title, 2026-10-19.)
   4016  fd36							; StepsLeft = previous SWCHB sample (physics is skipped on title, so it is
   4017  fd36							; title-owned; the first play frame rewrites it as the step budget).
   4018  fd36							; Console switches are read again after any jsr (LoadLevel clobbers X/Y/A).
   4019  fd36							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4020  fd36				   TitleWork
   4021  fd36							; --- SELECT edge (TitleSelect, fill region) ---
