   4129  fdad							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4130  fdad							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   4131  fdad							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   4132  fdad							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF4 always
   4133  fdad							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   4134  fdad							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   4135  fdad							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   4136  fdad							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   4137  fdad							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
