   4762  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4763  ffe6							; TallyTramp ($FFE6, byte-identical with BANK1 now — the body moved there in
   4764  ffe6							; repack chunk 3, 2026-10-20; guard: verify_build). bank0 jsr's here
   4765  ffe6							; (CheckMinerPickup arm / TallyWork step): `sta $1FF5` selects bank1, then the
   4766  ffe6							; jmp operand is fetched from bank1's image at the same PC (FoldIndirect
   4767  ffe6							; discipline). The bank1 body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> rts back to the
   4768  ffe6							; bank0 jsr. Ends $FFEB — $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (F6 hotspot mirrors).
   4769  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4770  ffe6		       f4 4f	   TallyEntry =	$F44F	; bank1 TallyEntry — operand must match label
   4771  ffe6				   TallyTramp
   4772  ffe6		       8d f5 1f 	      sta	$1FF5
   4773  ffe9		       4c 4f f4 	      jmp	TallyEntry
   4774  ffec
   4775  ffec							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4776  ffec							; HotOverlapFlag — bank3 entry tramp (C7 2026-10-20: the hot walk went back
   4777  ffec							; to bank3 with the shape/extras stream it reads). Moved off $FE90 into the
   4778  ffec							; 6-byte gap after TallyTramp. bank0 executes `sta $1FF7`; the `jmp` at +3 is
   4779  ffec							; fetched from bank3's image at $FFEF (guard: check_moth_tramp).
   4780  ffec							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4781  ffec					      .ds	$FFEC - *, 0
